message: "If you use RAID-SQL, please cite this software and the accompanying dissertation / ICAIT paper."
title: "RAID-SQL: Retrieval-Augmented Decomposed Text-to-SQL"
authors:
  - family-names: Myat
    given-names: Aung Kaung
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
url: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/RAID-SQL"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/RAID-SQL"
abstract: >
  RAID-SQL extends DIN-style Text-to-SQL with structure-aware retrieval,
  database-value grounding, execution-guided repair, and self-consistency
  on Gemini 2.5 Flash. Locked Spider-test official EX is 87.38% (1876/2147),
  exceeding DIN-SQL's published 85.3%.
keywords:
  - Text-to-SQL
  - Spider
  - DIN-SQL
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - Gemini
